       The  ssttrrccaasseeccmmpp()  function  performs  a byte‐by‐byte comparison of the
       strings _s_1 and _s_2, ignoring the case of the characters.  It returns  an
       integer  less  than, equal to, or greater than zero if _s_1 is found, re‐
